title: Operation Snowball Sliver C2 Domain (api.tablacysexplorer.com)
id: 51a9540b-1b4e-4855-963c-c69856c85202
status: experimental
description: Detects web traffic to api.tablacysexplorer.com, the Sliver v1.7.8 command-and-control domain used in Operation Snowball, the autonomous AI-agent intrusion against a European telecommunications provider and thirteen hosted organizations documented by Malbear Labs in November 2026. The same campaign used Sliver listeners on 146.70.53.182:2299, 113.23.212.15:8000 and 212.46.38.73:56777.
references:
  - https://malbearlabs.com/posts/operation-snowball-inside-an-autonomous-ai-intrusion-campaign
  - https://thecybersecguru.com/news/operation-snowball-deepseek-ai-cyberattack/
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/11/10
tags:
  - attack.t1071
  - attack.t1573
  - attack.t1190
  - attack.t1505
logsource:
  category: proxy
detection:
  selection_host:
    cs-host|endswith: 'tablacysexplorer.com'
  condition: selection_host
falsepositives:
  - Unlikely — the domain is dedicated attacker infrastructure with no legitimate use
level: critical
